  vendorName: Pharmacologist Crane
  offerText: Purchase a vial of my experimental cognitive enhancer. It costs a premium,
    but it requires zero space and will instantly cure your mental fatigue and physical
    aches.
  acceptResultText: You drink the vial. Your mind sharpens instantly, and every single
    ache in your body vanishes. You feel like a god!
  rejectResultText: You reject his unnatural chemicals. Your back still aches and
    you feel tired, but you trust your own body.
  acceptedDelayedText: The serum wears off, replaced by terrifying, agonizing withdrawal
    symptoms. You collapse to the floor, feverish and completely drained of life.
  rejectedDelayedText: 
